<title>FINLAND: Neste says has 40.1 pct of Asko.</title>
<headline>Neste says has 40.1 pct of Asko.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish oil and chemicals group Neste Oy said on Friday it had increased its direct and indirect stake in plastic pipes, white goods and furniture group Asko Oy to 40.1 percent last year.</p>
<p>&quot;During (1996) a six percent additional stake in Asko Oy was acquired. After that, Neste's direct and indirect holdings in Asko are 40.1 percent in total,&quot; Neste said in a statement with its 1996 results.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
